---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

const lastUpdated = "9 May 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Zondo Studios"
  description="How Zondo Studios handles personal information collected through zondostudios.com."
>
  <Nav />

  <section class="pt-32 pb-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight gradient-text">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500 font-mono">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-12">
      <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          This policy explains how Zachariah Peter Hondrou, trading as Zondo Studios ("we", "us", "our"), handles personal information collected through <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">zondostudios.com</strong> (the "Site"). Zondo Studios is operated as a sole trader in Australia.
        </p>
        <p>
          It does <strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">not</strong> cover our products. Jarrah Money and any future products operate under their own privacy policies, hosted at their own domains. Links are at the end of this page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Information we collect</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            The Site is intentionally minimal. We do not run our own analytics, set our own cookies, or operate any forms. The only personal information we receive directly is what you choose to send us by email.
          </p>
          <p>
            Information collected automatically by infrastructure we use:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Hosting (Squarespace):</strong> our hosting provider records standard server logs — IP addresses, browser type, pages visited, and timestamps. Squarespace also sets its own cookies for visitor analytics. See <a href="https://www.squarespace.com/privacy" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Squarespace's privacy policy</a> for details.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Fonts (Google):</strong> we load the Inter typeface from Google Fonts. Google receives standard request information (IP, user agent) when fonts are fetched. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy</a>.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Email:</strong> if you email <a href="mailto:hello@zondostudios.com" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">hello@zondostudios.com</a>, we receive your email address and the contents of your message.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">How we use it</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We use the information above to operate the Site, respond to inquiries you send us, and understand basic visitor patterns (via Squarespace's built-in analytics). We do not use it for advertising, profiling, or sale to third parties.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Sharing and disclosure</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We do not sell personal information. We share information only with the service providers required to operate the Site (Squarespace for hosting and analytics; Google for font delivery), and where required by law.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Cookies</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We do not set cookies directly. Squarespace may set cookies for visitor analytics and security. You can manage cookies in your browser settings; blocking them will not break the Site.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Your rights</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Under the Australian Privacy Principles (Privacy Act 1988), you can ask us to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Access the personal information we hold about you</li>
            <li>Correct information that is inaccurate or out of date</li>
            <li>Delete information we hold about you, where we are not required to keep it</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Email <a href="mailto:hello@zondostudios.com" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">hello@zondostudios.com</a> to make a request. We will respond within a reasonable timeframe.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you believe we have mishandled your information, you may complain to the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner (<a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">oaic.gov.au</a>).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">International transfers</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Squarespace and Google are based in the United States. By using the Site, you understand that your information may be processed outside Australia, in jurisdictions with different privacy protections.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Security</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We rely on the security practices of our hosting and email providers. No system is perfectly secure; if you have reason to believe our Site or your information has been compromised, please contact us immediately.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Children</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            The Site is not directed at children under 16. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We may update this policy as the Site changes or as our hosting and tooling change. The "Last updated" date at the top will reflect any revision. Material changes will be highlighted on the Site.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Product privacy policies</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Our products handle personal information separately, under their own policies:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Jarrah Money:</strong> <a href="https://jarrah.money/privacy" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">jarrah.money/privacy</a></li>
            <li><strong class="text-charcoal font-medium">Deal Estate:</strong> <a href="/deal-estate/privacy" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">zondostudios.com/deal-estate/privacy</a></li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            This policy does not cover information collected by those products.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-600 tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Contact</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Questions, requests, or complaints about this policy:
            <a href="mailto:hello@zondostudios.com" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">hello@zondostudios.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
